fluxecho.recipe.gene_assembler=Gene Assembly
fluxecho.gene_assembler.tip=§3Puts gene samples together: the traits you want, and only those§r\nWhatever is in the inputs is one job:\n  an imprint + gene samples -> the imprint with their genes (species kept)\n  two or more gene samples -> one sample with all their genes\nBees, trees and butterflies do not mix; two samples that disagree on a gene do not go together\nUses one of each; with AE turn on blocking mode\nSame result as putting them together in a crafting grid\n%s s per run, %s EU/t
